// Title: Sustained high CPU
// Source: Log Analytics
// Tables: Perf
// When to use: Triage for a High CPU alert: confirms whether the spike is sustained or a one-off.
// Tune: 90% over 15-minute bins. If you use VM insights, the same data is in InsightsMetrics (Namespace 'Processor', Name 'UtilizationPercentage').

Perf
| where TimeGenerated > ago(4h)
| where ObjectName == "Processor" and CounterName == "% Processor Time" and InstanceName in ("_Total", "total")
| summarize AvgCpu = round(avg(CounterValue), 1), MaxCpu = round(max(CounterValue), 1) by Computer, bin(TimeGenerated, 15m)
| where AvgCpu > 90
| order by Computer asc, TimeGenerated asc
